Description: Administration zone for AbraFlexi
 Web-based administration portal for AbraFlexi: customers, invoicing,
 payment matching, reminders, webhook processing, dashboards and
 integrations (IPEX, Subreg, Redmine, ISPConfig, Zabbix).
 Counterpart of abraflexi-clientzone for operators.
